en\":\"3.2 Limitation on Liability\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Whereas the services provided by Baopals Platform are of the nature of infomediary service, all information of shops and commodities on Baopals Platform (including and without limitation to names of shops, names of companies, liaisons and contact information, product description and specification, pictures and videos) are provided and uploaded by e-commerce platforms providing Baopals with its API, who and those shops operating on the named e-commerce platforms shall assume all legal responsibility for the said information.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Baopals Platform carries works (including contents on forum) for the purpose of transferring more information, which does not mean that Baopals agrees with the viewpoints in the works or has confirmed the trueness of the contents of the works.\"}]]}]]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"3.3 Protection of Intellectual Property Rights\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Baopals respects intellectual property rights and opposes any act of infringement and pirating. If a holder of intellectual property rights thinks that any content on Baopals Platform (including but without limitation to commodity information released by any member of Baopals Platform) may infringe any of his/her legitimate rights and benefits, he/she may send a written notice to Baopals' legal team at legal@baopals.com. After receiving the notice, Baopals will deal with such issue in time.\"}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"35:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-slot\":\"card\",\"className\":\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-1.5 rounded-xl border shadow-sm\",\"id\":\"privacy-policy\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-slot\":\"card-title\",\"className\":\"leading-none font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4. Privacy Right Policy\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-slot\":\"card-content\",\"className\":\"px-6 py-1 pb-6 space-y-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Baopals respects and strictly protect the personal information of the users. When you use the services of Baopals Platform, we will collect, use and share your personal information according to this Policy. This Policy contains terms and conditions on how we collect, store, use, share and protect your personal information. Through this Policy, we wish to clearly introduce to you how we deal with your personal information. Therefore, we advise you to read this Policy completely to understand the means of protecting your privacy right. If you have any doubt about this Policy, you're welcome to contact us through the means of contact published on Baopals Platform. If you do not agree to any contents of this Policy, you should stop using the services of Baopals Platform immediately. If you use the services of Baopals Platform in any way, you will be deemed to have agreed that we could use and protect your personal information according to this Policy.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.1 Scope of Application\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"To provide the users with better, higher-quality, more personalized services is our persistent pursuit. We also wish to provide more conveniences to your life through our services. This Policy is applicable to all services provided by Baopals Platform. When you visit Baopals Platform and/or log on any client concerned to use the services of Baopals Platform, this Policy will apply.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.2 How We Collect Information\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We collect information in order to provide you with better, higher-quality, and more personalized services. We collect information by the following means:\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 font-medium\",\"children\":\"Information Provided by You\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The information you fill in and/or submit when you register an account of Baopals or use the services of Baopals Platform, including your name, gender, date of birth, Passport ID, telephone number, email, address, Bank account information related to payment, and any additional information (such as the province and city you're in, postal code, etc.).\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 font-medium\",\"children\":\"Information Collected During Service Use\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"When you use the services of Baopals Platform or visit the web pages of Baopals Platform, Baopals will automatically receive and record the information on your browser and computer, including but without limitation to your IP address, the type of the browser, the language used, date and time of visit, information on characteristics of software and hardware and records on the web pages required by you; when you download or use any client software of Baopals or any of its affiliated companies, or access to mobile web pages to use the services of Baopals Platform, Baopals may read information related to your position and the mobile equipment you're using, including but without limitation to model of equipment, identification code of equipment, operating system, resolution and telecom operator.\"}],\"$L4d\",\"$L4e\"]}],\"$L4f\",\"$L50\"]}]]}],\"$L51\",\"$L52\",\"$L53\",\"$L54\",\"$L55\",\"$L56\"]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"36:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-slot\":\"card\",\"className\":\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-1.5 rounded-xl border s