mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"3.2 责任限制\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"鉴于Baopals平台提供的服务属于信息中介性质，Baopals平台上的店铺、商品信息（包括但不限于店铺名称、公司名称、联系人及联络信息、产品的描述和说明、相关图片、视频等）均由供应API端口的相关电商平台以及在该等电商平台上经营的商户会员对其提供并上传的所有信息承担全部法律责任。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Baopals平台转载作品（包括论坛内容）出于传递更多信息之目的，并不意味Baopals赞同其观点或已经证实其内容的真实性。\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"3.3 知识产权保护\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Baopals尊重知识产权，反对侵权盗版行为。知识产权权利人认为Baopals平台内容（包括但不限于Baopals平台会员发布的商品信息）可能涉嫌侵犯其合法权益，可以向Baopals法务部legal@baopals.com提出书面通知，Baopals收到后将及时处理。\"}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-slot\":\"card\",\"className\":\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-1.5 rounded-xl border shadow-sm\",\"id\":\"privacy-policy-zh\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-slot\":\"card-title\",\"className\":\"leading-none font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4. 隐私权政策\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-slot\":\"card-content\",\"className\":\"px-6 py-1 pb-6 space-y-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Baopals（下称\\\"我们\\\"）尊重用户个人信息的保护，在您使用Baopals平台提供的服务时，我们将按照本隐私权政策收集、使用及共享您的个人信息。本隐私权政策包含了我们收集、存储、使用、共享和保护您的个人信息的条款，我们希望通过本隐私权政策向您清晰地介绍我们对您个人信息的处理方式，因此我们建议您完整地阅读本隐私权政策，以帮助您了解维护自己隐私权的方式。如您对本隐私权政策有任何疑问，您可以通过Baopals平台公布的联系方式与我们联系。如果您不同意本隐私权政策任何内容，您应立即停止使用Baopals平台服务。当您使用Baopals平台提供的任一服务时，即表示您已同意我们按照本隐私权政策来合法使用和保护您的个人信息。\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.1 适用范围\"}],\"$L57\"]}],\"$L58\",\"$L59\",\"$L5a\",\"$L5b\",\"$L5c\",\"$L5d\",\"$L5e\"]}]]}],\"$L5f\"]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"38:[\"$\",\"$L60\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$3c\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@61\"}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"In addition to the information above, we may collect any other information about you in order to provide services to you and improve our service quality, including any information provided by you to our customer service team, your answers to our questionnaire, and any information collected by us when you interact with any affiliated company or partner of Baopals. Meanwhile, in order to improve safety when you use the services of Baopals Platform, prevent any phishing website from fraud more accurately, and block Trojan viruses, we may judge the risk of your account by knowing your habit of accessing web and information software commonly used by you, and may record some URLs which we deem to have risks.\"}]\n4e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"If you enable push notifications in the native Baopals app, we collect and store a push notification device token for your signed-in account and platform, such as Android or iOS. We use this token to deliver app notifications, including order and account updates. You can manage notification permissions through your device settings.\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4f:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 font-medium\",\"children\":\"Information from Third Parties\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"To provide you with better, higher-quality, more personalized services, or provide services to you together with Baopals, or prevent Internet fraud, the affiliated companies and partners of Baopals will share your personal information with Baopals according to law, any agreement with you, or with your consent in advance.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4\",\"children\":\"You acknowledge and agree that any of the following information is not governed by this Policy:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-disc space-y-2 pl-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Key words input by you when you use the search services of Baopals Platform\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Transaction data on Baopals Platform collected by Baopals when you do not select the function of \\\"Buying Anonymously\\\" and/or \\\"Assessing Anonymously\\\" including but without limitation to bid, closing information and assessing particulars\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Credit assessment, acts in violation of laws, regulations or the rules of Baopals, and measures taken by Baopals against you\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Enterprise name and other industrial and commercial registration information as well as information on natural persons as operators as required to be disclosed by laws and regulations\"}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"50:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 rounded-lg border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 p-4 dark:border-blue-800 dark:bg-blue-950\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h4\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 font-semibold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100\",\"children\":\"Collection and Use of Image Information\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3 text-sm text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"When you use our app, we may collect image information that you upload or provide. This could include images you take with your device's camera, images you select from your device's photo library, or images you provide in other ways.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The images you provide to us are primarily used for:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Personalizing your experience with our app\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Improving the performance and functionality of our app\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Assisting with product returns, tracking packages, or helping users find specific products\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We process this image data in accordance with applicable legal requirements and our legitimate business interests.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Your images remain your property. We do not claim any ownership rights in the images you provide. We only retain your images for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy, unless otherwise required by law.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We use reasonable security measures to protect your images against unauthorized access, use, alteration, or destruction. However, no transmission of data over the internet can be guaranteed to be completely secure, so we cannot ensure or warrant the security of any information you transmit to us.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"If you have any questions about our collection and use of image information, please contact us at support@baopals.com.\"}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"51:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.3 How We Use Your Information\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2\",\"children\":\"We collect your information for the purpose of providing you with services and improving the service quality. Therefore, we will use your information for the following purposes:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-disc space-y-2 pl-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Various services you are using, as well as maintenance and improvement of these services\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Recommending to you any contents which you may be interested in, including but without limitation to sending product and service information to you, or displaying personalized third party promotion information to you through the system, or sharing information with the partners of Baopals with your consent in advance so that they send information about their products and services to you\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"We may use your personal information to prevent, discover and investigate fraud, any act endangering security, illegal activity, or any other act which violates any agreement, policy or rule of us or any of our affiliated companies so as to protect the legitimate rights and benefits of you, any other user of us, us or any of our affiliated companies\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"We may combine your personal information from one kind of service with information from any other kind of service so as to provide you with more personalized services, for example, use, share or disclose your personal information so as to provide you with broader society of friends\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Any other purpose as permitted by you\"}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"52:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.4 How We Share Information\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We're obliged to keep your personal information confidential and will not sell or rent any of your personal information to any third party for the purpose of the marketing of the third party, provided that we may share your personal information with the third party under any of the following circumstances:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-disc space-y-2 pl-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Obtaining your consent or authorization in advance\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"As required by laws and regulations or administrative or judicial organ\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Sharing your personal information with any of the affiliated companies of Baopals\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Providing your personal information to reliable partners so that they could deal with such information according to our instructions, the privacy right policies and any other applicable confidentiality and safety measures\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"If you're an eligible complainant of intellectual property rights and file a complaint, disclosing your personal information to the complained as required by the complained so as to solve the potential dispute in time\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Only if we share your personal information, we could provide services as required by you or deal with any dispute between you and any third party. For example, with respect to a transaction created by you in Baopals, if either party performs all or part of his/her obligations and requires disclosure of information, Baopals will provide the party with the contact information of the counterparty and other necessary information (as the case may be) so as to boost the consummation of the transaction or solving of any dispute\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"If you violate laws and regulations of China or related agreements or rules of Baopals, disclosing to any third party whenever necessary\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Safeguarding legitimate rights and benefits of Baopals and its affiliated parties or users\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"53:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.5 Use of Cookie and Beacon\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"To provide you with easier experiences, when you access relevant websites of Baopals Platform or use the services of Baopals Platform, we may identify your identity through small data files. In this way, we can help you omit inputting some existing registration information or judge the security of your account. These data files may be Cookies, Flash Cookies or local storage provided by your browser or affiliated application (hereinafter collectively referred to as \\\"Cookies\\\").\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Please understand that some of our services are only available through \\\"Cookies\\\". If permitted by your browser or additional browser services, you may amend your degree of acceptance towards Cookies or refuse Cookies of Baopals, which may influence your safe access to related websites of Baopals Platform or use of the services of Baopals Platform under certain circumstances.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"There are often some electronic images (called \\\"GIF files\\\" or \\\"iBeacon\\\") in web pages. The use of iBeacon may help the website calculate the number of the users who browse web pages or access to certain cookies. We will use iBeacon to collect information on you browsing web pages, such as the address of web pages you're visiting, position of the reference page you previously accessed to, the period during which you stop on the page, your browsing environment and display setup.\"}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"54:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.6 Storage of Information\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Your personal information and data collected by Baopals will be stored in the servers of Baopals and (or) its affiliated companies. This information and data may be sent to the country or region where you're located or the place where Baopals collects such information and data, and will be accessed, stored and displayed at such place.\"}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"55:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.7 Protection of Your Personal Information\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"To guarantee the security of your personal information and prevent it from being disclosed, damaged or lost, we will take physical, electronic and management measures to protect your information, including but without limitation to SSL, storage encryption and control over access to data center. We also strictly manage the employees or contractors who may access to your personal information, including but without limitation to adopting post-based capacity control, signing confidentiality agreements with them, and supervising their operation. Baopals will use all available technologies to protect your personal information and prevent your personal information from being disclosed, damaged or lost.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Your account has security protection function. Please keep your account and passwords properly. Baopals will take such security measures as backup in other servers and encryption of passwords to guarantee that your personal information will not be lost, misused or altered. Notwithstanding the said security measures, you are reminded that there is no \\\"perfect security measures\\\" in information network.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"When you use the services of Baopals Platform to engage in online transactions, you will have to disclose your personal information to the counterparty or potential counterparty, such as way of contact or postal code. Please keep your personal information properly and only disclose to others when necessary. If you find that any of your personal information is disclosed, especially your account or password, please contact the customer service personnel of Baopals in time so that Baopals could adopt relevant measures.\"}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"56:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.8 Juvenile Protection\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We will neither knowingly collect information on any juvenile nor advice any juvenile to use our services. Unless permitted by law and approved by the guardian, the juvenile may not register an account or send their name, address, telephone or email address to us. If we collect any information about the juvenile negligently, we will delete as soon as possible when we become aware of it. If you think that we might hold information from or on any juvenile, please contact us.\"}]]}]\n57:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"为用户提供更好、更优、更个性化的服务是Baopals坚持不懈的追求，也希望通过我们提供的服务可以更方便您的生活。本隐私权政策适用于Baopals平台提供的所有服务，您访问Baopals平台网站及/或登陆相关客户端使用Baopals平台提供的服务，均适用本隐私权政策。\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"58:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.2 我们如何收集信息\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"我们收集信息是为了向您提供更好、更优、更个性化的服务，我们收集信息的方式如下：\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 font-medium\",\"children\":\"您向我们提供的信息\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"当您注册Baopals账户及您在使用Baopals平台提供的相关服务时填写及/或提交的信息，包括您的姓名、性别、出生年月日、护照号码、电话号码、电子邮箱、地址、支付方式相关的各类银行卡账号及相关附加信息（如您所在的省份和城市、邮政编码等）。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 font-medium\",\"children\":\"在您使用服务过程中收集的信息\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"为了提供并优化您需要的服务，我们会收集您使用服务的相关信息，这类信息包括：\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"在您使用Baopals平台服务，或访问Baopals平台网页时，Baopals自动接收并记录的您的浏览器和计算机上的信息，包括但不限于您的IP地址、浏览器的类型、使用的语言、访问日期和时间、软硬件特征信息及您需求的网页记录等数据；如您下载或使用Baopals或其关联公司客户端软件，或访问移动网页使用Baopals平台服务时，Baopals可能会读取与您位置和移动设备相关的信息，包括但不限于设备型号、设备识别码、操作系统、分辨率、电信运营商等。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"除上述信息外，我们还可能为了提供服务及改进服务质量的合理需要而收集您的其他信息，包括您与我们的客户服务团队联系时您提供的相关信息，您参与问卷调查时向我们发送的问卷答复信息，以及您与Baopals的关联方、Baopals合作伙伴之间互动时我们收集的相关信息。与此同时，为提高您使用Baopals平台提供的服务的安全性，更准确地预防钓鱼网站欺诈和木马病毒，我们可能会通过了解一些您的网络使用习惯、您常用的软件信息等手段来判断您账户的风险，并可能会记录一些我们认为有风险的URL。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"如果您在Baopals移动客户端中开启推送通知，我们会为您的已登录账户收集并保存推送通知设备令牌以及平台信息（例如Android或iOS）。我们使用该令牌向您发送应用通知，包括订单和账户相关更新。您可以通过设备设置管理通知权限。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 font-medium\",\"children\":\"来自第三方的信息\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"为了给您提供更好、更优、更加个性化的服务，或共同为您提供服务，或为了预防互联网欺诈的目的，Baopals的关联方、合作伙伴会依据法律的规定或与您的约定或征得您同意的前提下，向Baopals分享您的个人信息。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4\",\"children\":\"您了解并同意，以下信息不适用本隐私权政策：\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-disc space-y-2 pl-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"您在使用Baopals平台提供的搜索服务时输入的关键字信息\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"在您未选择\\\"匿名购买\\\"和/或\\\"匿名评价\\\"功能时，Baopals收集到的您在Baopals平台进行交易的有关数据，包括但不限于出价、成交信息及评价详情\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"信用评价、违反法律规定或违反Baopals规则行为及Baopals已对您采取的措施\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"应法律法规要求需公示的企业名称等相关工商注册信息以及自然人经营者的信息\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 rounded-lg border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 p-4 dark:border-blue-800 dark:bg-blue-950\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h4\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 font-semibold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100\",\"children\":\"收集和使用图像信息\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3 text-sm text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"当您使用我们的应用程序时，我们可能会收集您上传或提供的图像信息。这可能包括您使用设备相机拍摄的图像，您从设备的照片库中选择的图像，或者您以其他方式提供的图像。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"您提供给我们的图像主要用于以下目的：\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"个性化您使用我们应用的体验\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"改进我们应用的性能和功能，包括调试、内部运营，以及提供和改进我们的服务的研究\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"协助产品退货，追踪包裹，或帮助用户寻找特定产品\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"我们根据适用的法律要求和我们的合法商业利益处理这些图像数据。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"您的图像仍然是您的财产。我们并不主张对您提供的图像的所有权。除非法律另有要求，否则我们只保留您的图像，直到完成本隐私政策中列出的目的为止。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"我们使用合理的安全措施保护您的图像免受未经授权的访问、使用、更改或销毁。然而，互联网上的数据传输不能保证完全安全，因此我们不能保证您传输给我们的任何信息的安全。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"如果您对我们收集和使用图像信息有任何疑问，请通过 support@baopals.com 与我们联系。\"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"59:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.3 我们如何使用信息\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2\",\"children\":\"因收集您的信息是为了向您提供服务及提升服务质量的目的，为了实现这一目的，我们会把您的信息用于下列用途：\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-disc space-y-2 pl-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"向您提供您使用的各项服务，并维护、改进这些服务\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"向您推荐您可能感兴趣的内容，包括但不限于向您发出产品和服务信息，或通过系统向您展示个性化的第三方推广信息，或者在征得您同意的情况下与Baopals的合作伙伴共享信息以便他们向您发送有关其产品和服务的信息\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"我们可能使用您的个人信息以预防、发现、调查欺诈、危害安全、非法或违反与我们或其关联方协议、政策或规则的行为，以保护您、其他我们用户，或我们或其关联方的合法权益\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"我们可能会将来自某项服务的个人信息与来自其他服务的信息结合起来，用于为了给您提供更加个性化的服务使用，例如让您拥有更广泛的社交圈的需要而使用、共享或披露\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"经您许可的其他用途\"}]]}]]}]\n5a:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.4 我们如何共享信息\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"我们对您的信息承担保密义务，不会为满足第三方的营销目的而向其出售或出租您的任何信息，我们会在下列情况下才将您的信息与第三方共享：\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-disc space-y-2 pl-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"事先获得您的同意或授权\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"根据法律法规的规定或行政或司法机构的要求\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"向Baopals的关联方分享您的个人信息\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"向可信赖的合作伙伴提供您的个人信息，让他们根据我们的指示并遵循我们的隐私权政策以及其他任何相应的保密和安全措施来为我们处理这些信息\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"如您是适格的知识产权投诉人并已提起投诉，应被投诉人要求，向被投诉人披露，以便双方处理可能的权利纠纷\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"只有共享您的信息，才能提供您需要的服务，或处理您与他人的纠纷或争议。例如您在Baopals上创建的某一交易中，如交易任何一方履行或部分履行了交易义务并提出信息披露请求的，Baopals会视情况向该用户提供其交易对方的联络方式等必要信息，以促成交易的完成或纠纷的解决\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"如您出现违反中国有关法律、法规或者Baopals相关协议或相关规则的情况，需要向第三方披露\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"为维护Baopals及其关联方或用户的合法权益\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n5b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.5 Cookie 和网络 Beacon 的使用\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"为使您获得更轻松的访问体验，您访问Baopals平台相关网站或使用Baopals平台提供的服务时，我们可能会通过小型数据文件识别您的身份，这么做是帮您省去重复输入注册信息的步骤，或者帮助判断您的账户安全。这些数据文件可能是Cookie，Flash Cookie，或您的浏览器或关联应用程序提供的其他本地存储（统称\\\"Cookie\\\"）。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"请您理解，我们的某些服务只能通过使用\\\"Cookie\\\"才可得到实现。如果您的浏览器或浏览器附加服务允许，您可以修改对Cookie的接受程度或者拒绝Baopals的Cookie，但这一举动在某些情"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"况下可能会影响您安全访问Baopals平台相关网站和使用Baopals平台提供的服务。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"网页上常会包含一些电子图象（称为\\\"单像素\\\" GIF 文件或 \\\"网络 beacon\\\"），使用网络beacon可以帮助网站计算浏览网页的用户或访问某些cookie，我们会通过网络beacon收集您浏览网页活动的信息，例如您访问的页面地址、您先前访问的援引页面的位址、您停留在页面的时间、您的浏览环境以及显示设定等。\"}]]}]]}]\n5c:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.6 信息存储\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Baopals收集的有关您的信息和资料将保存在Baopals及（或）其关联公司的服务器上，这些信息和资料可能传送至您所在国家、地区或Baopals收集信息和资料所在地并在该地被访问、存储和展示。\"}]]}]\n5d:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.7 您的个人信息保护\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"为保障您的信息安全，我们努力采取各种合理的物理、电子和管理方面的安全措施来保护您的信息，使您的信息不会被泄漏、毁损或者丢失，包括但不限于SSL、信息加密存储、数据中心的访问控制。我们对可能接触到您的信息的员工或外包人员也采取了严格管理，包括但不限于根据岗位的不同采取不同的权限控制，与他们签署保密协议，监控他们的操作情况等措施。Baopals会按现有技术提供相应的安全措施来保护您的信息，提供合理的安全保障，Baopals将尽力做到使您的信息不被泄漏、毁损或丢失。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"您的账户均有安全保护功能，请妥善保管您的账户及密码信息。Baopals将通过向其它服务器备份、对用户密码进行加密等安全措施确保您的信息不丢失，不被滥用和变造。尽管有前述安全措施，但同时也请您理解在信息网络上不存在\\\"完善的安全措施\\\"。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"在使用Baopals平台服务进行网上交易时，您不可避免的要向交易对方或潜在的交易对方披露自己的个人信息，如联络方式或者邮政地址。请您妥善保护自己的个人信息，仅在必要的情形下向他人提供。如您发现自己的个人信息泄密，尤其是你的账户及密码发生泄露，请您立即联络Baopals客服，以便Baopals采取相应措施。\"}]]}]]}]\n5e:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4.8 未成年人保护\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"我们不会在知情的情况下收集未成年人的个人信息，也不建议未成年人使用我们的服务。除非所在地法律允许并且监护人同意，未成年人请不要注册账户或发送自己的姓名、住址、电话、邮件地址等个人信息给我们。如果我们不小心收集到了未成年人的信息，我们在知情后会尽快删除。如果您认为我们可能不当地持有来自于或关于未成年人的信息，请联系我们。\"}]]}]\n5f:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-slot\":\"card\",\"className\":\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-1.5 rounded-xl border shadow-sm\",\"id\":\"contact-zh\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-slot\":\"card-title\",\"className\":\"leading-none font-semibold\",\"children\":\"5. 联系方式\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-slot\":\"card-content\",\"className\":\"px-6 py-1 pb-6 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"如对本隐私政策有任何疑问，请通过以下方式联系我们：\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"电子邮件：\"}],\" support@baopals.com\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"法律咨询：\"}],\" legal@baopals.com\"]}],[\"$\""])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"公司名称：\"}],\" 上海珀购网络科技有限公司\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"注册号：\"}],\" 913100000885141873\"]}]]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3a:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover\"}]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"62:I[27201,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3kdbdvfmynwkt.js?dpl=dpl_8Re8tMV1GGh63LVCELiBwtpeXeLw\"],\"IconMark\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3d:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Privacy Policy | Baopals\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Baopals Privacy Policy - How we collect, use, and protect your personal information\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/manifest.webmanifest\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"privacy pol